###
//GET notes
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notes

###
//GET notes
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tree

###
//GET notes-content
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notes/content?path=notes/work/todo.md

###
//PUT writing the or updating notes-content
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "notes/work/todo.md",
  "content": "# Work Todo\n\n- [x] Learn TypeScript\n- [ ] Finish Interview Project"
}

###
//POST creating a new note
POST http://localhost:5000/api/create-new-note
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "notes/work/meetings/sprint-15.md",
  "title": "Sprint 15 Planning",
  "content": "# Sprint 15 Planning\n\n- [ ] Prepare agenda\n"
}

###
//GET linked notes
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notes/links?path=notes/work/todo.md